# Copy to .env and fill in real values. NEVER commit the filled-in file:
# anything prefixed with VITE_ is compiled into the public JavaScript bundle and
# is readable by anyone who opens the app.

# --- Supabase ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The anon key is a *publishable* key on purpose: it identifies the project, it
# does not authenticate a user. Access control lives in Postgres (RLS) plus the
# server-side checks, so treat it as public and rotate it if it ever leaves
# production by accident.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="YOUR-ANON-KEY"

# --- Google AI --------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed if the Gemini integration is ever wired up on a server. A key with
# the VITE_ prefix would be published to every browser, so keep it server-side.
# GEMINI_API_KEY="SERVER-SIDE-ONLY"

# --- Microsoft Power Automate ----------------------------------------------
# Intentionally NOT a VITE_ variable. That trigger URL contains a live "sig="
# token, and anything in the bundle can be copied by any visitor, which would let
# them run your automation. A master admin pastes it once per device from
# Company Settings -> Link Settings; it is stored in that browser only.

# --- App URL ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Used for self-referential links. Safe to expose.
# APP_URL="https://YOUR-APP.example.com"